          <li>StayNest shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of the Platform.</li>
          <li>Our total liability to you for any claim shall not exceed the amount you paid to StayNest in the 12 months preceding the claim.</li>
